Package: xsrv-web
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: libc6 (>= @GLIBC@), libgcc-s1
Recommends: xauth
Suggests: ffmpeg
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Description: X11 server whose screen is a web page
 xsrv-web is an X11 server written in Rust. X clients draw on it as on any
 X server, and a web page shows the screen and sends the keyboard and the
 mouse. It has RENDER, SHAPE, MIT-SHM, XFIXES and RANDR, a built-in window
 manager, and runs with external managers such as i3.
